### Independent UDS baseline draft, NOT approved (2026-09-12)

User explicitly requires no UDS or UnrealMCP dependencies. A 15-asset comparison
copy exists under ReferenceUDS, authored by rxsky_uds_reference.py. Material,
function, collection, texture and volume source-sheet pointers were remapped to
owned copies. Recursive material dependency audit visited 17 packages with no
/Game/UltraDynamicSky or UnrealMCP references; engine RemapValueRange and engine
Interchange import metadata remain. This is not a plugin-disabled cook test.

The copied material compiled but produced no visible clouds in live captures.
Replacing collection reads with local scalar/vector parameters did not resolve
it. The helper's first local_parameters call partially completed the main graph
before the enum mapping was fixed; skip_main=True then completed both functions.
Do not rerun the helper blindly: it is a one-time authoring draft, not idempotent.
The comparison is not baking compatible and must NOT be assigned to the baker.
The original working VolumeSculpt, 2.25/10 km layer, review exposure -12, light
50000 and sky radiance 2600 were restored to the baking map. Temporary capture
was destroyed. New comparison assets remain isolated for further diagnosis.
No equal-quality claim, full promotion verification, bake or preview validation.
